It is recommended that having selected the set  of  devices  that
you  are liable to need, that the remainder of the drivers be put
in here.  Not only is this tidier, but you can then if  you  wish
make  'unused'  a separate mountable filesystem, and save on-line
space.  Further,  the object modules for  unused  device  drivers
can  then be removed from LIB2.  The space that this will save is
considerable.
